return ['domain'=>'zinn-order-updates','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'so_SO','project-id-version'=>'zinn-order-updates','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-11-11T11:19:43+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-11-11T11:19:43+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Order Updates'=>'Zinn® Order Updates','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-order-updates'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-order-updates','SMS and WhatsApp order updates for your store, sent through Zinn® Campaigns under your store\'s own name. Connect in one click; no keys to paste.'=>'Wararka dalabka ee SMS iyo WhatsApp ee dukaankaaga, oo lagu soo diro Zinn® Campaigns iyadoo la adeegsanayo magaca dukaankaaga. Ku xir hal gujin; ma jiraan furayaal la dhejinayo.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Read and send SMS and WhatsApp order updates for this store.'=>'Akhri oo dir wararka ku saabsan dalabka ee SMS iyo WhatsApp ee dukaankan.','The WooCommerce order ID.'=>'Aqoonsiga (ID) dalabka WooCommerce.','Get order messages'=>'Hel fariimaha dalabka','Lists every SMS or WhatsApp update for one order, newest first, with its outcome. The phone number is masked.'=>'Waxay taxdaa cusboonaysiin kasta oo SMS ama WhatsApp ah oo loogu talagalay hal dalab, kuwa ugu dambeeya ayaana horreeya, oo ay la socoto natiijadiisu. Lambarka taleefanka waa la qariyey.','Send an order update'=>'Dir cusbooneysiinta dalabka','Sends one approved order update (never free text) to the shopper of the order, only if they agreed to receive it. Reusing a request_id never sends twice.'=>'Waxay u diraysaa hal cusboonaysiin dalab oo la ansixiyay (marnaba qoraal bilaash ah ma aha) qofka iibsaday dalabka, kaliya haddii uu oggolaaday inuu helo. Dib-u-isticmaalka request_id marnaba laba jeer ma diro.','Which approved update to send.'=>'Cusboonaysiinta la ansixiyay ee la dirayo.','A unique ID for this send (8 to 64 letters, digits, dots, dashes or underscores). Send the same ID again to retry safely.'=>'Aqoonsi gaar ah oo loogu talagalay diriddaan (8 ilaa 64 xaraf, tiro, dhibco, xariiqo ama hoos-ka-xariiq). Mar kale dir isla aqoonsiga si aad si ammaan ah ugu celiso.','Optional https tracking link for a shipped update.'=>'Xiriirinta raadraaca https ee ikhtiyaariga ah ee cusbooneysiinta la diray.','Get connection health'=>'Hel caafimaadka xiriirka','Shows whether this store is connected to Zinn® Campaigns and what Zinn® Campaigns sees for it.'=>'Waxay muujinaysaa haddii dukaankani ku xiran yahay Zinn® Campaigns iyo waxa Zinn® Campaigns u arko isaga.','Choose one of the approved order updates.'=>'Dooro mid ka mid ah cusbooneysiinta dalabka ee la ansixiyay.','The request ID must be 8 to 64 letters, digits, dots, dashes or underscores.'=>'Aqoonsiga codsiga waa inuu ahaadaa 8 ilaa 64 xaraf, tiro, dhibco, xariiqyo ama xariiqyo hoose.','Connect this store to Zinn® Campaigns first.'=>'Marka hore dukaankan ku xir Zinn® Campaigns.','There is no order with that ID on this store.'=>'Dukaankan kuma jirto dalab wata aqoonsigaas.','Zinn® Campaigns could not be reached. Try again in a minute.'=>'Lama xiriiri karin Zinn® Campaigns. Mar kale isku day daqiiqad kadib.','Zinn® Campaigns refused the request.'=>'Zinn® Campaigns way diidday codsiga.','Order Updates'=>'Cusboonaysiinta Dalabka','Your store is connected to Zinn® Campaigns.'=>'Dukaankaagu wuxuu ku xidhan yahay Zinn® Campaigns.','Your store is disconnected. No messages will be sent.'=>'Dukaankaaga waa la jaray. Ma jiro farriimo la diri doono.','That connection took too long or was started in another browser. Press Connect again.'=>'Xiriirkaasi wuxuu qaatay waqti aad u dheer ama waxaa laga bilaabay biraawsar kale. Mar kale taabo Ku xir.','Zinn® did not accept the connection. Press Connect again; if it keeps failing, contact Zinn® support.'=>'Zinn® ma aqbalin xiriirka. Mar kale taabo "Ku xir"; haddii ay sii socoto guul-darradu, la xiriir taageerada Zinn®.','Your site could not reach Zinn®. Check that your host allows outgoing connections, then press Connect again.'=>'Boggaagu ma gaari karin Zinn®. Hubi in martigeliyahaagu oggol yahay xiriirrada baxaya, ka dibna mar kale taabo «Ku xir».','Help'=>'Caawinaad','Send your customers SMS and WhatsApp updates about their orders, under your store\'s own name, paid from your Zinn® credit.'=>'U dir macaamiishaada wararka ku saabsan dalabyadooda adigoo isticmaalaya SMS iyo WhatsApp, oo wata magaca dukaankaaga, lagana bixiyay dhibcahaaga Zinn®.','Connect opens Zinn® in this window. Sign in or create an account, approve this store, and you come straight back here. You never paste a key.'=>'Ku xidh waxay ku furaysaa Zinn® daaqadan. Soo gal ama samayso koonto, ansixi dukaankan, waxaadna si toos ah ugu soo noqonaysaa halkan. Waligaa furaha ma dhejisanaysid.','Connect to Zinn® Campaigns'=>'Ku xir Zinn® Campaigns','Connected, but Zinn® could not be reached just now. We will try again shortly.'=>'Waa ku xidhan yahay, laakiin Zinn® lama xidhiidhi karin hadda. Wax yar ka dib ayaannu mar kale isku dayi doonnaa.','Store'=>'Dukaan','Connected'=>'Ku xiran','Zinn® Campaigns'=>'Zinn® Campaigns','Open for your account'=>'U furan koontadaada','Not open for your account yet. Zinn® will e-mail you when it is.'=>'Weli uma furna koontadaada. Zinn® ayaa iimayl kuu soo diri doona marka ay diyaar noqoto.','Disconnect'=>'Kala fur','You are not allowed to connect this store.'=>'Loma oggola inaad ku xirto dukaankan.','You are not allowed to disconnect this store.'=>'Lamaad ogolaan inaad ka goyso dukaankan.','Send me order updates by SMS to my phone number. Message and data rates may apply. Reply STOP to stop.'=>'Iigu soo dir wixii ku cusub dalabka SMS ahaan lambarkayga taleefanka. Waxaa laga yaabaa inay khuseeyaan khidmadaha fariimaha iyo xogta. Ka jawaab STOP si aad u joojiso.','Connection'=>'Xiriirinta','You are not allowed to do that.'=>'Loma oggola inaad taas samayso.','Thank you. You can now ask for help and send reports to Zinn® support.'=>'Mahadsanid. Hadda waxaad codsan kartaa caawimaad waxaadna warbixinno u diri kartaa taageerada Zinn®.','Consent withdrawn. Nothing is sent to Zinn® support until you agree again.'=>'Oggolaanshaha waa lagala noqday. Waxba looma diri doono taageerada Zinn® ilaa aad mar kale ogolaato.','The Zinn® AI could not answer just now. Send your question to the team below; a person will reply.'=>'Zinn® AI ma awoodin inay hadda jawaabto. Su\'aashaada u dir kooxda hoose; qof baa ka jawaabi doona.','Glad that solved it.'=>'Waan ku faraxsanahay in taasi xallisay.','Sent. Your ticket is %s; the team replies here and by e-mail.'=>'Waa la diray. Tikidhkaagu waa %s; kooxdu halkan iyo iimaylka ayay kaga jawaabi doontaa.','Fill in the subject, the message and, while your store is not connected, your e-mail address.'=>'Buuxi mowduuca, farriinta iyo, inta dukaankaagu aanu ku xidhnayn, cinwaankaaga iimaylka.','Zinn® did not accept the ticket. Check the fields and try again; if it keeps failing, e-mail support@zinndigital.com.'=>'Zinn® ma aqbalin tigidhkii. Hubi meelaha bannaan oo isku day mar kale; haddii ay sii socoto guul-darradu, iimayl u dir support@zinndigital.com.','Too many requests in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again.'=>'Codsiyo aad u badan waqti gaaban gudaheed. Fadlan sug dhowr daqiiqo oo mar kale isku day.','Reply sent.'=>'Jawaabta waa la diray.','That ticket is closed. Send a new ticket instead.'=>'Tigidkaasi waa xidhan yahay. Taas bedelkeeda soo dir tigidh cusub.','Your reply could not be sent. Try again in a moment.'=>'Jawaabtaada lama diri karin. Wax yar ka dib mar kale isku day.','Waiting on Zinn® support'=>'Sugaya taageerada Zinn®','Waiting on you'=>'Adiga ayaa lagu sugayaa','Answered'=>'Waa laga jawaabay','Closed'=>'Xiran','Report a bug'=>'Soo sheeg cillad','Send feedback'=>'Dir ra\'yi-celin','Request a feature'=>'Codso sifo','Ask for help'=>'Weydiiso caawimaad','Versions: WordPress, PHP, this plugin, WooCommerce (and whether it uses HPOS) and the supported plugins we detected'=>'Noocyada: WordPress, PHP, furahan, WooCommerce (iyo haddii ay isticmaasho HPOS) iyo furayaasha la taageero ee aan ogaannay','Your active theme and its version'=>'Mowduucaaga shaqeynaya iyo noociisa','The list of installed plugins, their versions and whether each is active'=>'Liiska furayaasha la rakibay, noocyadooda iyo haddii mid kastaa shaqaynayo','Connection: your store address, whether it is connected, this install\'s id and whether Zinn® answered its last check (never the store\'s token)'=>'Xiriirinta: cinwaanka dukaankaaga, haddii uu ku xiran yahay, id-ga rakibaaddan iyo haddii Zinn® uu ka jawaabay hubintii ugu dambeysay (marnaba astaanta dukaanka)','Zinn® Order Updates: Help'=>'Cusbooneysiinta Dalabka Zinn®: Caawinaad','Withdraw my consent to send help requests'=>'Kala noqo oggolaanshahayga dirista codsiyada caawinta','Help here is answered by Zinn Digital® Ltd. Before anything leaves your site, this is exactly what is sent, and where:'=>'Caawinta halkan waxaa ka jawaabaya Zinn Digital® Ltd. Kahor inta aysan waxba ka bixin goobtaada, tani waa sida saxda ah waxa la diro, iyo meesha loo diro:','A question you type: sent to the Zinn® AI at api.zinndigital.com, which answers from the Zinn® help articles.'=>'Su\'aal aad qorto: waxaa loo diraa Zinn® AI ee api.zinndigital.com, kaas oo kaga jawaabaya maqaallada caawinta ee Zinn®.','A ticket you send: its subject, your message, your admin language and a reply e-mail address, sent to Zinn® support.'=>'Tigidh aad dirto: mawduuciisa, fariintaada, luqaddaada maamulka iyo cinwaanka iimaylka jawaabta, oo loo diray taageerada Zinn®.','Diagnostics: only the blocks you tick, each shown in full before you send. Never the store\'s token, passwords or your customers\' details.'=>'Baaritaannada: kaliya baloogyada aad calaamadeyso, mid kasta oo si buuxda loo muujiyey ka hor inta aadan dirin. Weligaa astaanta dukaanka, furaha sirta ah ama faahfaahinta macaamiishaada.','Your tickets: while your store is connected, this screen reads your tickets and the team\'s replies from Zinn®.'=>'Tigidhadaada: inta dukaankaagu ku xidhan yahay, shaashadani waxay akhrinaysaa tigidhadaada iyo jawaabaha kooxda ee ka socda Zinn®.','We record who agreed and when. You can withdraw at any time on this screen.'=>'Waxaan diiwaangelineynaa cidda oggolaatay iyo goorta ay oggolaatay. Waxaad kala noqon kartaa wakhti kasta shaashadan.','Agree and continue'=>'Oggolow oo sii wad','Ask the Zinn® AI'=>'Waydii Zinn® AI','What do you need help with?'=>'Maxaad caawimaad uga baahan tahay?','Ask'=>'Weydii','Help articles'=>'Maqaallada caawinta','That solved it'=>'Tani way xallisay','Still need help? Send it to the team below.'=>'Weli ma u baahan tahay caawimaad? U dir kooxda hoose.','Send it to the Zinn® team'=>'U dir kooxda Zinn®','What is it?'=>'Waa maxay?','Subject'=>'Mowduuc','What happened? For a bug, the steps that show it.'=>'Maxaa dhacay? Haddii uu qalad yahay, tillaabooyinka muujinaya.','Reply e-mail'=>'Iimaylka jawaabta','Leave empty to use the e-mail of the Zinn® member who connected this store.'=>'Faaruq kaga tag si aad u isticmaasho iimaylka xubinta Zinn® ee ku xidhay dukaankan.','Your store is not connected, so the team replies by e-mail.'=>'Dukaankaagu ma xirna, markaa kooxdu waxay kaga jawaabaysaa iimayl.','Diagnostics (optional). Tick a block to attach it; this is exactly what is sent.'=>'Baaritaanka cilladaha (ikhtiyaari). Sax sanduuqa si aad ugu lifaaqdo; tani waa dhab ahaan waxa la dirayo.','Send to Zinn® support'=>'U dir taageerada Zinn®','My tickets'=>'Tigidhadeyda','Connect your store to follow your tickets here. Until then the team replies by e-mail.'=>'Ku xidh dukaankaaga si aad halkan ugala socoto tikidhadaada. Ilaa waqtigaas kooxdu waxay kaga jawaabaysaa iimayl.','Your tickets could not be loaded just now. Try again in a moment.'=>'Tigidhadaada lama soo shubi karin hadda. Fadlan wax yar ka dib mar kale isku day.','No tickets yet.'=>'Weli ma jiraan wax tigidh.','Zinn® support replied on %s:'=>'Taageerada Zinn® waxay ku jawaabtay %s:','Your reply'=>'Jawaabtaada','Send reply'=>'Dir jawaabta','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn® SMS and WhatsApp sign-up'=>'Isku-diiwaangelinta SMS-ka iyo WhatsApp-ka ee Zinn®','Lets visitors sign up for offers and news by SMS or WhatsApp. Unticked by default; marketing only.'=>'Waxay u oggolaanaysaa booqdayaasha inay iska diiwaangeliyaan dalabyada iyo wararka SMS ama WhatsApp ahaan. Si caadi ah looma calaamadin; suuqgeyn keliya.','Sign-up settings'=>'Habsocodka isdiiwaangelinta','Channel'=>'Kanaalka','SMS'=>'SMS','WhatsApp'=>'WhatsApp','Visitor chooses SMS or WhatsApp'=>'Soo-booqwaha wuxuu doortaa SMS ama WhatsApp','Zinn® SMS offers consent'=>'Oggolaanshaha dalabyada SMS-ka ee Zinn®','Zinn® WhatsApp offers consent'=>'Oggolaanshaha dalabyada WhatsApp ee Zinn®','Records a marketing opt-in in Zinn® Campaigns for the phone number in this form.'=>'Waxay Zinn® Campaigns ku diiwaangelisaa oggolaanshaha suuqgeynta ee lambarka taleefanka ku jira foomkan.','Send me offers and news on WhatsApp to this number. Optional; unsubscribe any time.'=>'Iigu soo dir dalabyada iyo wararka WhatsApp-ka ee lambarkan. Waa ikhtiyaari; iska jooji wakhti kasta.','Send me offers and news by SMS to this number. Optional; unsubscribe any time by replying STOP. Message and data rates may apply.'=>'Iigu soo dir dalabyada iyo wararka SMS ahaan lambarkan. Waa ikhtiyaari; ka bax rukumashada wakhti kasta adigoo ku jawaabaya STOP. Qiimaha fariimaha iyo xogta ayaa laga yaabaa inay khuseeyaan.','Connect this store to Zinn® Campaigns to show this sign-up form.'=>'Ku xidh dukaankan Zinn® Campaigns si aad u muujiso foomkan is-diiwaangelinta.','Mobile number'=>'Lambarka taleefanka gacanta','How should we send them?'=>'Sideen u soo dirnaa?','Send me offers and news by the channel I chose above. Optional; unsubscribe any time.'=>'Iigu soo dir dalabyada iyo wararka kanaalka aan kor ku doortay. Ikhtiyaari; waad ka bixi kartaa wakhti kasta.','Leave this empty'=>'Meeshan faaruq uga tag','Sign up'=>'Isku qor','Thank you, you are signed up. You can unsubscribe any time.'=>'Waad mahadsan tahay, waad is diiwaangelisay. Waad ka bixi kartaa wakhti kasta.','Please enter your mobile number with its country code, for example +44 7700 900123.'=>'Fadlan geli lambarkaaga mobaylka adoo raacinaya koodhka dalka, tusaale ahaan +44 7700 900123.','Please tick the box to agree.'=>'Fadlan calaamadee sanduuqa si aad u aqbasho.','This form was open for a long time. Please reload the page and send it again.'=>'Foomkan waxa uu furnaa muddo dheer. Fadlan dib u soo geli bogga oo mar kale dir.','Too many sign-ups from here. Please wait a few minutes and try again.'=>'Isqorista meeshaan ka timid aad bay u badan tahay. Fadlan sug dhowr daqiiqo oo mar kale isku day.','We could not save your sign-up. Please check your number and try again.'=>'Ma aanan keydin karin diiwaangelintaada. Fadlan hubi lambarkaaga oo mar kale isku day.','my account endpoint slugmessages'=>'Farriimaha','Messages'=>'Farriimaha','Text me updates about my orders'=>'Fariin qoraal ah iigu soo dir wararka ku saabsan dalabyadayda','Text me offers and news from this store'=>'Fariin qoraal ah iigu soo dir dalabyada iyo wararka dukaankan','Send me offers and news from this store on WhatsApp'=>'Iigu soo dir dalabyada iyo wararka dukaankan WhatsApp-ka','Order received'=>'Dalabka waa la helay','Payment received'=>'Lacagtii waa la helay','Order on hold'=>'Dalabka waa la hakiyay','Order shipped'=>'Dalabka waa la diray','Order completed'=>'Dalabka waa la dhammeystiray','Ready for pickup'=>'Diyaar u ah qaadashada','Payment failed'=>'Bixintu waa fashilantay','Order cancelled'=>'Dalabkii waa la tirtiray','Order refunded'=>'Dalabka waa la celiyay','Order update'=>'Cusboonaysiinta dalabka','Your message settings cover the mobile number on your orders with this store. Use the number from one of your orders.'=>'Dejinta fariimahaagu waxay khuseysaa lambarka gacanta ee dalabyadaada dukaankan. Isticmaal lambarka mid ka mid ah dalabyadaada.','Your message settings are saved.'=>'Fariintaada habeynteeda waa la keydiyay.','Done. This store will not send you any more messages.'=>'Waa la dhammeeyay. Dukankani dambe kuuma soo diri doono wax farriimo ah.','Please enter a mobile number with its country code, for example +44 7700 900123.'=>'Fadlan geli lambarka taleefanka gacanta oo ay ku jirto koodhka dalka, tusaale ahaan +44 7700 900123.','We could not save your settings just now. Please try again in a minute.'=>'Hadda ma aannu badbaadin karin habayntaada. Fadlan hal daqiiqo ka dib mar kale isku day.','Your message settings cannot be shown just now. Please try again in a minute.'=>'Lama muujin karo habaynta fariimahaaga hadda. Fadlan isku day mar kale daqiiqad kadib.','Messages from this store'=>'Farriimaha dukaankan','Save'=>'Kaydi','Stop all messages'=>'Jooji dhammaan fariimaha','Recent messages'=>'Farriimihii dhowaa','This store has not sent you any messages yet.'=>'Dukaankani weli wax fariimo ah kuuma soo dirin.','%1$s, order %2$s, %3$s'=>'%1$s, dalabka %2$s, %3$s','Sign in to manage the messages this store sends you.'=>'Soo gal si aad u maamusho fariimaha uu dukaankani kuu soo diro.','Zinn® message settings'=>'Habsocodka fariinta Zinn®','Lets a signed-in shopper change the text messages your store sends them, stop them all, and see the last 20.'=>'Waxay u oggolaanaysaa macmiilka soo galay inuu beddelo fariimaha qoraalka ah ee uu dukaankaagu u soo diro, joojiyo dhammaantood, oo arko 20-kii ugu dambeeyay.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — hagayaal iyo adeegyo','User guides'=>'Hagayaasha isticmaalaha','Read the %s user guide'=>'Akhri hagaha isticmaalaha %s','Hide this'=>'Qari tan','Zinn® Pro Membership: every Pro plugin, one licence'=>'Xubinnimada Zinn® Pro: plugin kasta oo Pro ah, hal ruqsad','The Pro versions of Page Builder Sandwich, Tranzly, Zinn® SEO, Zinn® Cache and Zinn® Backups, and every Pro plugin we release next, from %s a year. A second membership adds Zinn® Chat Pro.'=>'Noocyada Pro ee Page Builder Sandwich, Tranzly, Zinn® SEO, Zinn® Cache iyo Zinn® Backups, iyo plugin kasta oo Pro ah oo aan xiga soo saarno, laga bilaabo %s sanadkii. Xubin labaad waxay ku daraysaa Zinn® Chat Pro.','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Martigelinta Zinn® ee WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, kaydinta maalinlaha ah, wareejinta bilaashka ah iyo qaybta koontaroolka oo loo dhisay dadka maamula wax ka badan hal goob.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Suuqa Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Iibso oo iibi mareegaha dhisan, magacyada domain-ka iyo meelaynta xiriiriyaha, iyadoo lacagta si ammaan ah loo hayo ilaa labada dhinacba ay ku qancaan.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — shaqaalayso dad shaqadoodu tahay arrintan','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Suuqa xorta ah ee adduunka oo dhan: baadh in ka badan 10,000 oo adeegyo diyaarsan oo ka socda qorayaasha, naqshadeeyayaasha, horumariyayaasha iyo khubarada SEO, ama dheji mashruuc oo u oggolow inay dalab soo gudbiyaan.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Fiiri qoraallada soo-deynta ee Zinn Digital®.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Adeegga cusboonaysiinta ee Zinn® ma bixinin xiriirinta soo dejinta ee cusboonaysiintan. Hubi in boggani gaari karo madasha Zinn®, ka dibna isku day mar kale.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Cusboonaysiinta lagama soo dejisan karin adeegga cusboonaysiinta Zinn® (%s). Fadlan isku day mar kale dhowr daqiiqo ka dib.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Cusbooneysiinta la soo dejiyay kuma guulaysan hubinta sax ahaanshaha loomana rakibin.','Order updates'=>'Wararka dalabka','Opted in (yes or no)'=>'Doortay (haa ama maya)','Channel (SMS or WhatsApp)'=>'Kanaalka (SMS ama WhatsApp)','WhatsApp link'=>'Xiriirinta WhatsApp','Message us on WhatsApp'=>'Farriin noogu soo dir WhatsApp','Zinn® WhatsApp button'=>'Bawshanka WhatsApp ee Zinn®','A button that opens a WhatsApp chat with your store. It shows only once your WhatsApp number is connected in Zinn® Campaigns.'=>'Badhan furaya wada shekaysiga WhatsApp ee dukaankaaga. Waxa kaliya oo ay soo baxaysaa marka lambarkaaga WhatsApp lagu xidho Zinn® Campaigns.','Button settings'=>'Habsameynta badhanka','Button text'=>'Qoraalka badhanka','Show to'=>'U muuji','Everyone'=>'Qof walba','Shoppers not yet getting order updates'=>'Iibsadayaashu weli ma helaan cusbooneysiinta dalabka','Connect your WhatsApp number in Zinn® Campaigns to show this button. Until then it shows nothing on your site.'=>'Ku xidh lambarkaaga WhatsApp gudaha Zinn® Campaigns si aad u muujiso badhankan. Ilaa markaas waxba kama muujin doono goobtaada.']];